# ---- eval working data and run outputs (gigabytes, all regenerable) ----
# cv-workspace/ is 2.7GB of agent run outputs from the skill evaluations and
# evals/{datasets,real,real_prepared} is 3.1GB of image data. Neither belongs in
# git; evals/answer_keys/ IS kept, because the ground truth is what makes the
# eval reproducible. See README for where to obtain the image sets.
